{"source":"permission-request","action":"shell","resource":{"resources":["gh pr create --repo fajardoclark359-alt/mailforen --head ritchegerona:master --base master --title \"Comprehensive test suite, CI, safety gates, docs, and GUI\" --body \"$(cat << 'EOF'\n## Summary\n\nThis PR merges the `contribution/tests-ci-docs` branch (by @fajardoclark359-alt) and adds comprehensive documentation, GUI commits, and integration fixes.\n\n## Changes\n\n### From contribution/tests-ci-docs (10 commits)\n- **Test suite**: 154 hermetic tests covering all modules (zero network access)\n- **CI/CD**: GitHub Actions workflow (ruff, mypy, pytest on Python 3.11-3.13)\n- **Safety gate**: `--unsafe` global flag + `require_unsafe()` in `core/safety.py`\n- **Rate limiting**: `HTTPClient` enforces `settings.rate_limit_delay` (default 1s)\n- **URL tracer fix**: `HEAD` no longer follows redirects (enables manual redirect tracing)\n- **Single-sourced version**: `mailforen.__version__` used everywhere\n- **PDF generation**: Fixed `weasyprint` import typo (was `weasyhtml`)\n- **README fixes**: Corrected CLI examples to match actual command tree\n- **CONTRIBUTING.md** and **MIT LICENSE** added\n\n### Integration & Conflict Resolution\n- Kept `PySide6>=6.8.0` + `mailforen-gui` entry point in `pyproject.toml`\n- Kept robust `extract_domain_from_email()` handling display names/angle brackets\n- Used upstream's superior `generator.py` (weasyprint fix, `__version__`, UTC timestamps)\n- Fixed entry point naming: `mailforen` → CLI, `mailforen-gui` → GUI\n\n### GUI (9 files, ~1,380 LOC)\n- `app.py`, `main_window.py`, `tabs.py`, `components.py`, `state.py`, `workers.py`, `theme.py`\n- Case management, analysis tabs (Email, Domain, IP, URL), findings, reports\n- `Worker(QThread)` pool for background DNS/HTTP\n- Dark theme with QSS styling\n\n### Documentation (MkDocs, 12 files)\n- Getting Started: Installation, Quick Start, Safety & Ethics\n- CLI Reference: Complete command documentation\n- API Reference: All 15 modules with classes/methods\n- Architecture: Component diagram, data flow, security boundaries\n- Usage Guide: Phishing triage checklist, workflows\n- Development: Testing patterns, project layout\n- Reference: Changelog\n\n## Verification\n\n```bash\npytest -q          # 154 passed in ~1.5s\nruff check mailforen tests\nmypy mailforen\nmailforen version  # v0.1.0\nmailforen --unsafe version  # Shows unsafe warning\n```\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\nNone. All changes are additive or fix existing behavior.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Tests pass (154/154)\n- [x] Lint clean (ruff)\n- [x] Type check clean (mypy)\n- [x] CLI works\n- [x] GUI imports (headless Qt)\n- [x] Documentation builds (MkDocs)\nEOF\n)\"","cat << 'EOF'\n## Summary\n\nThis PR merges the `contribution/tests-ci-docs` branch (by @fajardoclark359-alt) and adds comprehensive documentation, GUI commits, and integration fixes.\n\n## Changes\n\n### From contribution/tests-ci-docs (10 commits)\n- **Test suite**: 154 hermetic tests covering all modules (zero network access)\n- **CI/CD**: GitHub Actions workflow (ruff, mypy, pytest on Python 3.11-3.13)\n- **Safety gate**: `--unsafe` global flag + `require_unsafe()` in `core/safety.py`\n- **Rate limiting**: `HTTPClient` enforces `settings.rate_limit_delay` (default 1s)\n- **URL tracer fix**: `HEAD` no longer follows redirects (enables manual redirect tracing)\n- **Single-sourced version**: `mailforen.__version__` used everywhere\n- **PDF generation**: Fixed `weasyprint` import typo (was `weasyhtml`)\n- **README fixes**: Corrected CLI examples to match actual command tree\n- **CONTRIBUTING.md** and **MIT LICENSE** added\n\n### Integration & Conflict Resolution\n- Kept `PySide6>=6.8.0` + `mailforen-gui` entry point in `pyproject.toml`\n- Kept robust `extract_domain_from_email()` handling display names/angle brackets\n- Used upstream's superior `generator.py` (weasyprint fix, `__version__`, UTC timestamps)\n- Fixed entry point naming: `mailforen` → CLI, `mailforen-gui` → GUI\n\n### GUI (9 files, ~1,380 LOC)\n- `app.py`, `main_window.py`, `tabs.py`, `components.py`, `state.py`, `workers.py`, `theme.py`\n- Case management, analysis tabs (Email, Domain, IP, URL), findings, reports\n- `Worker(QThread)` pool for background DNS/HTTP\n- Dark theme with QSS styling\n\n### Documentation (MkDocs, 12 files)\n- Getting Started: Installation, Quick Start, Safety & Ethics\n- CLI Reference: Complete command documentation\n- API Reference: All 15 modules with classes/methods\n- Architecture: Component diagram, data flow, security boundaries\n- Usage Guide: Phishing triage checklist, workflows\n- Development: Testing patterns, project layout\n- Reference: Changelog\n\n## Verification\n\n```bash\npytest -q          # 154 passed in ~1.5s\nruff check mailforen tests\nmypy mailforen\nmailforen version  # v0.1.0\nmailforen --unsafe version  # Shows unsafe warning\n```\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\nNone. All changes are additive or fix existing behavior.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Tests pass (154/154)\n- [x] Lint clean (ruff)\n- [x] Type check clean (mypy)\n- [x] CLI works\n- [x] GUI imports (headless Qt)\n- [x] Documentation builds (MkDocs)\nEOF"]},"userIntent":"make a PR to this fajardoclark359-alt/mailforen"}
